From 675f31c647fd6392a669afc3ba0bedfdfb59f9a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: milliluk-erik <build@localhost>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 12:42:09 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 42/49] -init-delay: hold the first scripted input, for entropy

audit.h also carries audit_bits_mc6809(), the audit-bit composition the
CoCo 3 originally kept privately in coco3.c: it reads only shared 6809
core state (mem_class, irq_depth), so it lives with the AUDIT_* legend
it composes and both 6809 machine families call it.
